# Test files are kept local only, not published to the module.
# The Go white-box tests (package profiles / tls_client / tls_client_cffi_src)
# must stay next to the code they test, so they are ignored in place rather
# than moved: `go test ./...` still runs locally, they just do not go to git.
# The tests/ folder holds the black-box integration suite, also local only.
